    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mi>j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mi>k</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math>, with <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>10</mn><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mn>3</mn></math>,&nbsp;</p><p>Let us assume that&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced></math></p><p>Now we know that,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>So, combining both above equations we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8805;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>&#8805;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mtext>max</mtext><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>A</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is true</p><p>Now again solving,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>And&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover></mfenced><mo>&#8804;</mo><mn>3</mn><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mtext>max</mtext><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><mrow><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\"><msub><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo></mover><mn>3</mn></msub></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Hence,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>B</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is also true.</p>"
